          ]
        }
      ],
      "text": "The table above summarizes the core capitalization and identities of the primary transaction participants. The transaction is structured as a sequential-pay cash-flow CLO. Silverbrook Asset Management (the 'Manager') has broad authority to select assets and manage the portfolio under the terms of the Management Agreement."
    },
