          },
          "charspan": [
            0,
            337
          ]
        }
      ],
      "text": "The notes and the majority of assets are indexed to Term SOFR. However, 'Basis Risk' may arise if assets use different SOFR tenors (e.g., 1-month vs. 3-month) or if there are floors on the assets that differ from the floors on the notes. Changes in the SOFR rate will affect the yield to investors and the cost of funding for the Issuer."
    },
