            "r": 535.8998413085938,
            "b": 414.44000244140625,
            "coord_origin": "CoordOrigin.BOTTOMLEFT"
          },
          "charspan": [
            0,
            431
          ]
        }
      ],
      "text": "The leveraged loan market may experience periods of extreme illiquidity. During such times, the Manager may be unable to sell credit-risk assets or acquire new assets at attractive prices. This could negatively impact the diversity and quality of the portfolio. There is no guarantee that a secondary market for the notes will exist, and investors should be prepared to hold their investment until the Legal Final Maturity in 2038."
    },
