            "coord_origin": "CoordOrigin.BOTTOMLEFT"
          },
          "charspan": [
            0,
            334
          ]
        }
      ],
      "text": "The Collateral Administrator will publish Monthly Reports and Payment Date Reports. These reports include: (i) a list of all collateral obligations; (ii) a summary of all trades; (iii) calculations for all coverage and quality tests; and (iv) the amount of interest and principal to be paid to each class on the upcoming payment date."
