            "b": 542.0,
            "coord_origin": "CoordOrigin.BOTTOMLEFT"
          },
          "charspan": [
            0,
            353
          ]
        }
      ],
      "text": "Assets are valued at their principal balance, except for defaulted obligations, which are valued at the lower of their market value or the applicable recovery rate. Market value is determined using dealer quotes or recognized pricing services. If no market price is available, the Manager may provide a fair value estimate subject to certain conditions."
